3. Third-party outputs (not relicensed here)
--------------------------------------------
The following files are outputs of, or derived from, third-party models and databases. They
are distributed under those parties' terms, not under section 1 or 2.

- AlphaGenome outputs: splice_sv/alphagenome_control/results/per_variant_scores.csv,
  positive_ranks.csv and compare_ag_spliceai.csv. These are subject to the AlphaGenome Output
  Terms of Use (splice_sv/alphagenome_control/LEGALLY_BINDING_TERMS_OF_USE.txt;
  https://deepmind.google.com/science/alphagenome/output-terms): non-commercial use, and not for
  clinical decision-making. Cite Avsec et al. 2026.
- SpliceAI scores: splice_sv/alphagenome_control/results/spliceai_D50.vcf, the SpliceAI columns
  of compare_ag_spliceai.csv, and splice_sv/scripts/calibration/bub1b_spliceai_calibration.csv.
  These were generated with SpliceAI 1.3.1, whose models are licensed CC BY-NC 4.0. Cite
  Jaganathan et al. 2019, doi:10.1016/j.cell.2018.12.015.
- AlphaFold DB models: structures/BUBR1_AF_full.pdb and BUBR1_AF_kinase_766_1050.pdb, derived
  from AF-O60566-F1. AlphaFold DB data are CC BY 4.0. Cite Jumper et al. 2021 and the
  AlphaFold Protein Structure Database.
- ThermoMPNN predictions: structures/ThermoMPNN_inference_*.csv. Cite doi:10.1073/pnas.2314853121.
- Multiple sequence alignment: tools/ddgun-work/bubr1_kinase.aln and .prof, built with the
  ColabFold MMseqs2 server from UniRef sequences. UniProt data are CC BY 4.0.
- gnomAD-derived variant panels: splice_sv/alphagenome_control/data/bub1b_snvs.json, panel.json
  and panel.vcf. These are derived from gnomAD v4 public data; see the gnomAD terms.

No primary Hackathon data is included in this repository (see DATA_HANDLING.md).
